flowchart TD
    S((Start)) --> L[Citizen logs in with OTP]
    L --> T[Select request type]
    T --> F[Fill form]
    F --> U[Upload documents]
    U --> V{Eligibility & document check}
    V -- Fail --> E[Show error / missing items] --> F
    V -- Pass --> SB[Submit request + SMS acknowledgement]
    SB --> OV[Officer verifies documents]
    OV --> D{Decision}
    D -- Return --> CL[Citizen gets SMS to clarify] --> U
    D -- Reject --> RJ[Record reason + SMS] --> X((End))
    D -- Approve --> AP[Update ration card record]
    AP --> SM[Send approval SMS]
    SM --> IS[Issue / print card]
    IS --> X
